1.4.3. The Role of Artificial Intelligence
It is worth being explicit about the role of artificial intelligence (AI) in this enterprise, since AI is often seen as contrasting with cognitive science pure (engineering) AI versus mechanisms of human intelligence as if these were different subject matters. Soar itself
